## Success criteria

The wiki is doing its job when:

- A consumer agent answers ≥80% of background-knowledge queries from the bundle without falling back to web search.
- The linter reports 0 errors, <5% stale, <10% low-confidence pages.
- Bundles build cleanly and drop into downstream projects via `cp -r`.

